  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed side extension by reason of its size, siting, roof design, mass and enclosing of the gap, unbalances the appearance of the pair of semi-detached dwellings appearing bulky and incongruous, and represents an overly dominant, and visually intrusive form of addition out of keeping and character with and detrimental to the visual amenities of the subject property and surrounding area. The proposals are thereby contrary to Policies D3 of the London Plan (2021), Core Strategy (2010) Policy CP30 and Development Management Document (2014) Policies DMD8, DMD13, DMD14 and DMD37 and National Planning Policy Framework (2024)."
